# theme-switch-frames: frames after a theme click through the settings menu.
# Seeded dark/arctic-ice; the gear opens the menu, the Tron Cyan row (the
# reference's row at [1112,244,278,36], centre 1251,262) switches the theme.
# The cross-fade runs 250 ms linear; frames every 50 ms to 250 ms.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 1383 48
wait 500
click 1251 262
frames theme-switch every 50 for 250
